{
 "catalog": {
  "controls": [
   {
    "id": "etched-pt-1",
    "title": "PII redaction on publish",
    "links": [
     {
      "href": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final",
      "rel": "reference",
      "text": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5, PT family (privacy)"
     }
    ],
    "parts": [
     {
      "id": "etched-pt-1_smt",
      "name": "statement",
      "prose": "The CMS redacts PII automatically on publish. The original is kept only in the owner's private scope; every other surface receives the redacted form."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-pt-1_gdn",
      "name": "guidance",
      "prose": "CMS behaviour: publish path runs the redaction policy (name, email, phone) before rendering to web or team chat. A redaction notice names what was redacted and which policy did it."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-pt-1_asm",
      "name": "assessment",
      "prose": "Evidence: redaction operation receipt naming the triggering policy (operation_id, event_hash). Planned: receipt recorded as OSCAL assessment result and anchored on-chain."
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "name": "tag",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "pii"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "schema_tag_registry"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-operation",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "schema_tag_registry/tag-registry.get-policy"
     },
     {
      "name": "evidence-kind",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "redaction-receipt"
     },
     {
      "name": "implementation-status",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "planned"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "etched-au-1",
    "title": "Attributable actions (audit)",
    "links": [
     {
      "href": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final",
      "rel": "reference",
      "text": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5, AU family (audit)"
     }
    ],
    "parts": [
     {
      "id": "etched-au-1_smt",
      "name": "statement",
      "prose": "Every CMS create, edit, and publish action is attributable: who did it, under what capability, and when."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-au-1_gdn",
      "name": "guidance",
      "prose": "CMS behaviour: all mutations run through the subsidiary identity's 3tchedFS call files; the bridge checks the exact capability and commits via MutationEngine."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-au-1_asm",
      "name": "assessment",
      "prose": "Evidence: receipt chain per action (required_capability, operation_id, event_id, event_hash, outcome). Proven: bridge issues these fields on every admitted call."
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "name": "tag",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "audit"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "identity_sled"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-operation",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "identity_sled/get_own_identity"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "routing_decision"
     },
     {
      "name": "evidence-kind",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "operation-receipt"
     },
     {
      "name": "implementation-status",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "proven:bridge-receipts; planned:assessment-results-export"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "etched-ac-1",
    "title": "Least privilege with named refusals",
    "links": [
     {
      "href": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final",
      "rel": "reference",
      "text": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5, AC family (access control)"
     }
    ],
    "parts": [
     {
      "id": "etched-ac-1_smt",
      "name": "statement",
      "prose": "CMS roles compile into capability grants. Requests outside the grants are refused with the exact missing capability; root-level actions need two different human approvals."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-ac-1_gdn",
      "name": "guidance",
      "prose": "CMS behaviour: profile compiles to grants and budgets; the team-chat adapter holds no grants and never calls plugins directly. Refusals and approval requests render as first-class results."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-ac-1_asm",
      "name": "assessment",
      "prose": "Evidence: refusal receipt naming the missing capability and rule; approval record (1 of 2, 2 of 2). Proven: bridge refuses with exact capability name. Planned: two-person rule (elevation ticket is single-use today)."
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "name": "tag",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "access-control"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "elevation"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-operation",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "elevation/authorize_task"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "schema_tag_registry"
     },
     {
      "name": "evidence-kind",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "refusal-receipt"
     },
     {
      "name": "implementation-status",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "proven:bridge-refusal; planned:two-person-rule"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "etched-si-1",
    "title": "Scheduled retention and expiry",
    "links": [
     {
      "href": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final",
      "rel": "reference",
      "text": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5, SI-12 (information handling and retention)"
     }
    ],
    "parts": [
     {
      "id": "etched-si-1_smt",
      "name": "statement",
      "prose": "Published CMS content carries a retention schedule; expiry archives or deletes on time, automatically."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-si-1_gdn",
      "name": "guidance",
      "prose": "CMS behaviour: each publish sets expires_at; the scheduler runs the archive operation. No silent retention."
     },
     {
      "id": "etched-si-1_asm",
      "name": "assessment",
      "prose": "Evidence: scheduled-operation receipt (operation_id, event_hash) plus the archived artefact reference. Planned."
     }
    ],
    "props": [
     {
      "name": "tag",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "retention"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "cron"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-operation",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "cron/schedule"
     },
     {
      "name": "tched-plugin",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "workflows"
     },
     {
      "name": "evidence-kind",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "scheduled-operation-receipt"
     },
     {
      "name": "implementation-status",
      "ns": "https://3tched.com/ns/oscal",
      "value": "planned"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "etched-in-1",
    "title": "Hash-anchored integrity",
    "links": [
     {
      "href": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final",
      "rel": "reference",
      "text": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5, SI-7 (information integrity)"
     }
    ],
    "parts": [
     {
